  "description": "Layout used to update curves referenced in VCP, for Libor with FX variation expressed in other currencies, to report the FX variation expressed in other currencies of the TJMI, for Forward Contracts (valid only for entries made from the registration date up to D-1 of the contract start) and for Cupom Limpo on curves referenced in MOEDA.",
  "file_name_rule": "ACCRUAL_<VIEW>-<LOB>.txt (VIEW = BANCO / LAWTON / ATACAMA; LOB = CEM / EDG / HYB / COMM), unique-suffixed, written to the Batch Conecta folder and (best-effort) to the Regulatory Accrual evidence folder of the day",
  "notes": "The VCP page is linked with its own columns; the automatic file generation currently runs from the Accrual page only. One accrual row generates 1/2/4 records — one per updater view (BANCO always; LAWTON/ATACAMA added when the group counterparty account belongs to them) × VCP leg; records are split by view into separate files. The generator assigns role/curve '01' to the LARGER account number and '00' to the smaller, while the manual states the participant with the SMALLER account is ponta 01. Only the Fator is sent — the PU field is written blank (22 spaces). Generation and preview run through the File Interpreter engine (_fi_build_line): the Fixed literals (SWAP, line types, 0015, Tipo de Atualização 00, blank PU) come from this template — editing them changes the file.",
  "file_type": "positional",
  "separator": null,
